      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.49 (vs ₹3.64 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.49 (down from ₹3.64 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹446.9m (up 5.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹26.1m (down 59% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.8% (down from 15% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 76 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
